@startuml

title The provision answer: the fields the request returns

class "provision tenant answer" as provision_answer <<message>> #E1F5FF {
    {field} +tenant : id
    {field} +administrator : id
    {field} +run : id
}

note top of provision_answer
The answer to the provision request, once the tenant and its administrator exist.
id tenant // the identifier of the tenant the request created
id administrator // the identifier of the administrator the request created
id run // the identifier of the run that performs the rest of the starting point's operations
end note

@enduml
